ass=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/10\/DSC_4079.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"Some of the punishments included (1) having your tongue pierced with an iron peg if you spoke ill of the sovereign and (2) being boiled alive in a cauldron for counterfeiting coins.\n&lt;p&gt;With the French Revolution, all of this changed. The counts and rulers began to favor equality so they simply reached for the guillotine whenever someone was due for punishment.&lt;\/p&gt;\" data-attachment-id=\"3512\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"Some of the punishments included (1) having your tongue pierced with an iron peg if you spoke ill of the sovereign and (2) being boiled alive in a cauldron for counterfeiting coins.\n&lt;p&gt;With the French Revolution, all of this changed. The counts and rulers began to favor equality so they simply reached for the guillotine whenever someone was due for punishment.&lt;\/p&gt;\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2018\/10\/DSC_4079\/1695514753.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22150%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20150%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><\/span><span class=\"fg-image-overlay\"><\/span><\/a><figcaption class=\"fg-caption\"><div class=\"fg-caption-inner\"><div class=\"fg-caption-title\">Some of the punishments included (1) having your tongue pierced with an iron peg if you spoke ill of the sovereign and (2) being boiled alive in a cauldron for counterfeiting coins.\n<p>With the French Revolution, all of this changed. The counts and rulers began to favor equality so they simply reached for the guillotine whenever someone was due for punishment.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"fg-loader\"><\/div><\/div>